@startuml
title View Learning Statistics Sequence (/statistics and /api/admin/stats/learning, demographics)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Admin
boundary "Learning Statistics UI" as StatisticsUi
control "StatisticsController\n(FE Dashboard)" as FeController
control "AdminStatsController\n(BE API)" as BeController
entity "LearningStats\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeLearningStatsDto
entity "Demographics\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeDemographicsDto
entity "AdminLearningStatsResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeLearningStatsDto
entity "AdminDemographicsResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeDemographicsDto
control "AdminStatsService" as StatsService
control "IAdminStatsService" as IAdminStatsService
entity "TestAnswer" as TestAnswerEntity
entity "Word" as WordEntity
entity "TestSession" as TestSessionEntity
entity "UserLearningProfile" as LearningProfileEntity
entity "User" as UserEntity
entity "AgeRange" as AgeRangeEntity
entity "Occupation" as OccupationEntity
entity "EducationLevel" as EducationLevelEntity
control "AdminStatsRepository" as StatsRepository
control "IAdminStatsRepository" as IAdminStatsRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over StatisticsUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard UI file exists: Views/Statistics/Index.cshtml.
FE controller exists: StatisticsController.
BE controller exists: AdminStatsController.
FE response DTOs exist: LearningStats and Demographics.
BE response DTOs exist: AdminLearningStatsResponse and AdminDemographicsResponse.
StatisticsController.Index calls VocaNovaApiClient.GetLearningStatsAsync
and GetDemographicsAsync.
No request DTO body is used for these GET endpoints.
Interfaces used in code: IAdminStatsService, IAdminStatsRepository.
end note

Admin -> StatisticsUi: Open learning statistics
StatisticsUi -> FeController: GET /statistics

FeController -> BeController: VocaNovaApiClient.GetLearningStatsAsync\nGET /api/admin/stats/learning
BeController -> BeController: Check admin authorization
BeController -> IAdminStatsService: GetLearningStatsAsync()
IAdminStatsService -> StatsService: GetLearningStatsAsync()
StatsService -> StatsService: Calculate today, tomorrow,\ntrend window and top wrong word limit

StatsService -> IAdminStatsRepository: GetTopWrongWordsAsync(limit)
IAdminStatsRepository -> StatsRepository: GetTopWrongWordsAsync(limit)
StatsRepository -> DbContext: Query wrong answers by word
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT test_answers\nJOIN words and test_sessions
MySQL --> DbContext: Wrong word rows
DbContext -> TestAnswerEntity: Group TestAnswer rows
DbContext -> WordEntity: Read Word projection
DbContext -> TestSessionEntity: Filter completed sessions
TestAnswerEntity --> DbContext: TestAnswer aggregate
WordEntity --> DbContext: Word aggregate
TestSessionEntity --> DbContext: TestSession aggregate
DbContext --> StatsRepository: Top wrong word rows
StatsRepository --> StatsService: Top wrong words

StatsService -> IAdminStatsRepository: GetSessionAccuracyRowsAsync(window)
IAdminStatsRepository -> StatsRepository: GetSessionAccuracyRowsAsync(window)
StatsRepository -> DbContext: Query completed sessions
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT test_sessions
MySQL --> DbContext: Session rows
DbContext -> TestSessionEntity: Project TestSession rows
TestSessionEntity --> DbContext: Accuracy rows
DbContext --> StatsRepository: Accuracy trend rows
StatsRepository --> StatsService: Accuracy trend rows

StatsService --> BeController: Learning stats result
BeController -> BeLearningStatsDto: Create AdminLearningStatsResponse
BeLearningStatsDto --> BeController: AdminLearningStatsResponse
BeController -> FeLearningStatsDto: HTTP 200 OK\nAdminLearningStatsResponse JSON
FeLearningStatsDto --> FeController: LearningStats

FeController -> BeController: VocaNovaApiClient.GetDemographicsAsync\nGET /api/admin/stats/demographics
BeController -> BeController: Check admin authorization
BeController -> IAdminStatsService: GetDemographicsAsync()
IAdminStatsService -> StatsService: GetDemographicsAsync()
StatsService -> IAdminStatsRepository: GetDemographicsAsync()
IAdminStatsRepository -> StatsRepository: GetDemographicsAsync()

StatsRepository -> DbContext: Query active learning profiles\nby age range
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user_learning_profiles\nJOIN users and age_ranges
MySQL --> DbContext: Age range rows
DbContext -> LearningProfileEntity: Group UserLearningProfile rows
DbContext -> UserEntity: Filter active users
DbContext -> AgeRangeEntity: Read AgeRange projection
LearningProfileEntity --> DbContext: Learning profile aggregate
UserEntity --> DbContext: Active users
AgeRangeEntity --> DbContext: Age range groups
DbContext --> StatsRepository: Age range groups

StatsRepository -> DbContext: Query active learning profiles\nby occupation
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user_learning_profiles\nJOIN users and occupations
MySQL --> DbContext: Occupation rows
DbContext -> LearningProfileEntity: Group UserLearningProfile rows
DbContext -> UserEntity: Filter active users
DbContext -> OccupationEntity: Read Occupation projection
LearningProfileEntity --> DbContext: Learning profile aggregate
UserEntity --> DbContext: Active users
OccupationEntity --> DbContext: Occupation groups
DbContext --> StatsRepository: Occupation groups

StatsRepository -> DbContext: Query active learning profiles\nby education level
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user_learning_profiles\nJOIN users and education_levels
MySQL --> DbContext: Education level rows
DbContext -> LearningProfileEntity: Group UserLearningProfile rows
DbContext -> UserEntity: Filter active users
DbContext -> EducationLevelEntity: Read EducationLevel projection
LearningProfileEntity --> DbContext: Learning profile aggregate
UserEntity --> DbContext: Active users
EducationLevelEntity --> DbContext: Education level groups
DbContext --> StatsRepository: Education level groups

StatsRepository --> StatsService: Demographics groups
StatsService --> BeController: Demographics result
BeController -> BeDemographicsDto: Create AdminDemographicsResponse
BeDemographicsDto --> BeController: AdminDemographicsResponse
BeController -> FeDemographicsDto: HTTP 200 OK\nAdminDemographicsResponse JSON
FeDemographicsDto --> FeController: Demographics

FeController -> FeController: Build StatisticsViewModel
FeController --> StatisticsUi: Render learning statistics

@enduml
